    <description>Classifies a veteran&apos;s background description into a Next Mission specialty cluster. Queries all NM_Specialty_Cluster__mdt records, builds a key+label list, calls NM_Classify_Cluster_Template, then validates the returned key against live CMDT. Returns found=true + clusterKey on match; found=false + narrowingQuestion on no match. NMDH-20.</description>
